flowchart TD
  S[JSON / YAML suite] --> I[Validate input; strip model provenance]
  I --> P[Explicit rubric; labeled question/answer/reference; anchors]
  P --> O[Pointwise OR pairwise both orders]
  O --> J[Independent SmolLM2 judge]
  J --> L[Audit exact prompt + raw response + usage]
  J --> V{Parse + validate structured verdict}
  V -->|Malformed| F[Repair fences/commas/literals; one model retry]
  F --> V2{Valid after retry?}
  V2 -->|No| E[Explicit error; count in denominator]
  V2 -->|Yes| A[Aggregate per-criterion and overall scores]
  V -->|Valid| A
  A --> M[Remap A/B labels; disagree -> abstain; report coverage]
  M --> R[Suite report; A/B winner; bias/gold/retest validation]
